Test fixtures: responses of Île-de-France Mobilités' PRIM APIs
================================================================

The .json files in this directory are response bodies of the PRIM platform of Île-de-France Mobilités
(https://prim.iledefrance-mobilites.fr), recorded on 2026-11-18 for the tests. Each file name starts with the
time of the recording, in Paris time; the tests set their clock to it.

The queries name only stations and public places: Gare du Nord, Gare Saint-Lazare, Châtelet - Les Halles,
La Défense, Massy - Palaiseau, Orly airport, a point inside the Forum des Halles (48.8619, 2.3470), and the
public names "Victor Hugo" and "12 rue Victor Hugo", the Montreuil one of which is also looked up by its id.
Only response bodies were kept, no request header.

Source: Île-de-France Mobilités, PRIM. These data are not covered by the licence of the code. They are reused
under the licences of the APIs they come from, as the PRIM pages of these APIs stated them on 2026-11-18:

- Île-de-France Mobilités Calculator - Generic access (v2), the Navitia journey planner
  (places, places_nearby, journeys, pt_objects, lines, departures):
  https://prim.iledefrance-mobilites.fr/en/apis/idfm-navitia-general-v2
  Licence: Mobility License (Licence Mobilités).

- Île-de-France Mobilités Calculator - Traffic Info Messages (v2) (line_reports):
  https://prim.iledefrance-mobilites.fr/en/apis/idfm-navitia-line_reports-v2
  Licence: Mobility License (Licence Mobilités).

- Next Departures (Île-de-France Mobilités platform) - unitary request (stop-monitoring, SIRI Lite):
  https://prim.iledefrance-mobilites.fr/en/apis/idfm-ivtr-requete_unitaire
  The page lists the Mobility License in its details, and its "API Terms of Use and Data License" section
  says the data are under the Open Database License (ODbL).

Hand-edited copies
------------------

Files with "edited" in their name are recorded responses changed by hand for a test:

- 20261118T0520-siri-gare-du-nord-rer-b-edited-trip-number.json: a copy of
  20261118T0520-siri-gare-du-nord-rer-b.json where train PLIC06 is renamed ZZZZ06, and train INCA07, which
  runs the other way to Mitry - Claye, leaves at 04:35 UTC instead of 04:36, the minute of PLIC06.

- 20261118T0557-siri-gare-du-nord-rer-d-edited-cancelled.json: a copy of
  20261118T0557-siri-gare-du-nord-rer-d.json where train 153602 is cancelled instead of on time. The other
  cancelled trains in both files are as PRIM recorded them, on a strike day.
